{"chapter-slug":"rw8-22 HE","paragraph":708,"wording":"[Chancellor]","event":"named","holder-quote":"She went silent a third time as Desais slashed her hand and Yvlon’s mouth closed. Yvlon’s third mistake was threatening the [Weaver-Chancellor] with the immediate consequences of not helping her. Desais looked at Yvlon and came to a speedy decision.","id":"deb7194f-b00a-5e11-96cc-5db70fd9fd14"}
